From ba0868545688ba27798f51024f45801e837b839b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cctv4-cgtn <a20118189@163.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Jan 2026 13:41:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] erofs: Zstandard compression support

---
